Author: Lance Colton <lance.colton@gmail.com>
Date:   Fri Jun 26 13:47:21 2026 -0700

    feat: enhance insider and congress trades formatting and retrieval

    - Updated the `format_insider_trades` and `format_congress_trades` functions to return empty strings when no trades are found, improving clarity in the UI.
    - Added a `days` parameter to `format_congress_trades` for customizable lookback periods in the header.
    - Refactored the insider and congress trades retrieval functions to utilize new helper methods for better ticker management and data fetching.
    - Adjusted the context data packet to default to a 30-day lookback for congress trades, enhancing the relevance of displayed data.

    These changes improve the user experience by providing clearer outputs and more flexible data handling for trades.

